      "content": "it just feels like a trap. like, no matter how much i rest, it doesn't matter because i'll just wake up and it's the same thing all over again. i look at him/her and i know i have to stay, but there's this part of me that just wants it to be over. not like \"end it\" in a scary way, just like... i want to go to sleep and not have to deal with the weight of everything anymore. i just want it to stop.",
