    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say help is out there but what help is going to do is change the reality. it doesn't change the fact that they are sick and i am the only one here. it's just a constant cycle of misery for both of us. sometimes i think maybe the most merciful thing would just be for everything to go quiet. like, if i just weren't here, the pressure would finally be gone. does that sound crazy? it just feels like the only way to actually find peace.",
